### GlobeTrotter REST API Testing Collection

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. User Signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Rivera",
  "email": "alex.rivera@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. User Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@globetrotter.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Discover Cities
GET {{baseUrl}}/cities?search=Paris

### 6. Get Activities for City
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities

### 7. Create New Trip
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asian Odyssey 2026",
  "description": "Exploring Tokyo and Kyoto temples.",
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endDate": "2026-10-15",
  "isPublic": true
}

### 8. Get User Trips
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get Public Trip by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/trips/grand-european-escapade-2026

### 10. Copy Public Trip (Transactional Copy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/trips/grand-european-escapade-2026/copy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Get Admin Analytics (SQL Database Aggregation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
